    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 6(2)(b) and Section 21(2)(b) of the Town and Country Planning Ordinance (Chapter 269), I, Bimal Niroshan Rathnayaka, Minister of Transport, Highways and Urban Development do, by this Order,-",
